    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-7791-4179"))
Description: Automated generation of equivalent models in structural 
  equation modelling (SEM). Provide your model via lavaan syntax and receive
  in-depth information regarding all equivalent models generated
  (Lee and Hershberger, 1990).
